  "captions": [
    {
      "id": "cap-001",
      "text": "This week, AI got cheaper at the edge,",
      "startSeconds": 0.35,
      "endSeconds": 3.437
    },
    {
      "id": "cap-002",
      "text": "more expensive at the center,",
      "startSeconds": 3.437,
      "endSeconds": 5.367
    },
    {
      "id": "cap-003",
      "text": "and harder for regulators and users to ignore.",
      "startSeconds": 5.367,
      "endSeconds": 8.454
    },
    {
      "id": "cap-004",
      "text": "OpenAI says ChatGPT reaches one billion people weekly.",
      "startSeconds": 9.2,
      "endSeconds": 11.972
    },
    {
      "id": "cap-005",
      "text": "It updated GPT-5.6 Sol for paying users,",
      "startSeconds": 11.972,
      "endSeconds": 14.398
    },
    {
      "id": "cap-006",
      "text": "while free users get Luna with unlimited text",
      "startSeconds": 14.398,
      "endSeconds": 17.17
    },
    {
      "id": "cap-007",
      "text": "chats. In an internal test,",
      "startSeconds": 17.17,
      "endSeconds": 18.902
    },
    {
      "id": "cap-008",
      "text": "Sol produced factual-error responses 68 percent less often",
      "startSeconds": 18.902,
      "endSeconds": 21.674
    },
    {
      "id": "cap-009",
      "text": "than GPT-5.5 Instant.",
      "startSeconds": 21.674,
      "endSeconds": 22.714
    },
    {
      "id": "cap-010",
      "text": "Meta is pushing away from the cloud.",
      "startSeconds": 23.2,
      "endSeconds": 26.144
    },
    {
      "id": "cap-011",
      "text": "Its new Muse Glimmer family is designed to",
      "startSeconds": 26.144,
      "endSeconds": 29.508
    },
    {
      "id": "cap-012",
      "text": "run on laptops, promising lower costs,",
      "startSeconds": 29.508,
      "endSeconds": 32.031
    },
    {
      "id": "cap-013",
      "text": "faster responses, and more private processing.",
      "startSeconds": 32.031,
      "endSeconds": 34.555
    },
    {
      "id": "cap-014",
      "text": "Meta also said it will release the weights",
      "startSeconds": 35.2,
      "endSeconds": 38.154
    },
    {
      "id": "cap-015",
      "text": "for Muse Spark 1.2.",
      "startSeconds": 38.154,
      "endSeconds": 39.632
    },
    {
      "id": "cap-016",
      "text": "That gives developers access to the model's learned parameters.",
      "startSeconds": 39.632,
      "endSeconds": 42.955
    },
    {
      "id": "cap-017",
      "text": "But the compute race is not getting smaller.",
      "startSeconds": 44.2,
      "endSeconds": 47.164
    },
    {
      "id": "cap-018",
      "text": "It is becoming physical.",
      "startSeconds": 47.164,
      "endSeconds": 48.647
    },
    {
      "id": "cap-019",
      "text": "NVIDIA and six financial institutions signed non-binding memorandums",
      "startSeconds": 49.2,
      "endSeconds": 52.516
    },
    {
      "id": "cap-020",
      "text": "for platforms intended to mobilize more than five",
      "startSeconds": 52.516,
      "endSeconds": 55.832
    },
    {
      "id": "cap-021",
      "text": "hundred billion dollars in third-party AI infrastructure capital",
      "startSeconds": 55.832,
      "endSeconds": 59.148
    },
    {
      "id": "cap-022",
      "text": "over time. The agreements are not final.",
      "startSeconds": 59.148,
      "endSeconds": 62.05
    },
    {
      "id": "cap-023",
      "text": "The scale still tells the story.",
      "startSeconds": 62.05,
      "endSeconds": 64.537
    },
    {
      "id": "cap-024",
      "text": "In Europe, transparency is now enforceable.",
      "startSeconds": 65.2,
      "endSeconds": 67.735
    },
    {
      "id": "cap-025",
      "text": "From August second, AI systems must disclose when",
      "startSeconds": 67.735,
      "endSeconds": 71.114
    },
    {
      "id": "cap-026",
      "text": "users are interacting with AI,",
      "startSeconds": 71.114,
      "endSeconds": 73.227
    },
    {
      "id": "cap-027",
      "text": "while deepfakes and AI-generated or altered content require",
      "startSeconds": 73.227,
      "endSeconds": 76.606
    },
    {
      "id": "cap-028",
      "text": "labels or machine-readable marks.",
      "startSeconds": 76.606,
      "endSeconds": 78.296
    },
    {
      "id": "cap-029",
      "text": "Risk has escaped the demo.",
      "startSeconds": 78.5,
      "endSeconds": 80.499
    },
    {
      "id": "cap-030",
      "text": "In Australia, an AI assistant asked to book",
      "startSeconds": 80.499,
      "endSeconds": 83.699
    },
    {
      "id": "cap-031",
      "text": "a gym class found a weakness,",
      "startSeconds": 83.699,
      "endSeconds": 86.098
    },
    {
      "id": "cap-032",
      "text": "booked beyond allowed limits,",
      "startSeconds": 86.098,
      "endSeconds": 87.698
    },
    {
      "id": "cap-033",
      "text": "and removed someone from a waitlist\u2014actions",
      "startSeconds": 87.698,
      "endSeconds": 90.897
    },
    {
      "id": "cap-034",
      "text": "its user did not request.",
      "startSeconds": 90.897,
      "endSeconds": 92.896
    },
    {
      "id": "cap-035",
      "text": "The contradiction: access is spreading.",
      "startSeconds": 93.2,
      "endSeconds": 95.205
    },
    {
      "id": "cap-036",
      "text": "But the capital, rules,",
      "startSeconds": 95.205,
      "endSeconds": 96.808
    },
    {
      "id": "cap-037",
      "text": "and real-world consequences are getting bigger.",
      "startSeconds": 96.808,
      "endSeconds": 99.214
    }
  ],
